  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bogd Bank Financing Micro, Small and Medium-Sized Enterprises and Promoting Green Lending Activities Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ADB will provide a senior unsecured loan of up to $15 million with a tenor of up to 3 years to Bogd Bank to fund subloans to MSMEs. The ADB Loan comprises two tranches: (a) tranche A of $14 million for multi-sector finance to MSMEs with a minimum of 50% to be disbursed to WMSMEs; and (b) tranche B of $1 million for climate finance to MSMEs.</narrative>
  </description>
